  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPF: Accountable Grant Agreement with Sharenet Burundi.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support civil society groups to build &#x2018;home-grown&#x2019; capacity in Burundi including by establishing strong networks amongst themselves. It will further support the strengthening of civil society specifically in the run up to the 2025 local elections &#x2013; when they are particularly important and vulnerable to marginalisation.</narrative>
  </description>
